# Scripts on Windows write JSON/CSV in text mode (CRLF), while
# editor-authored files (city_name_aliases.json, band_name_aliases.json,
# app.js, styles.css, index.html, *.py) are LF -- this had already split
# the repo into two conventions with no enforcement. Normalize everything
# to LF in the repo, converting to the platform default on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
